**Test uptime as a correctness signal.** Most teams talk about their test suite after a merge. In our experience, the quicker the suite runs, the sooner a mismatch is noticed, and the sooner a value is settled. Running the helper alone, without the scorer, takes well under a second. Adding the scorer takes a little longer, and the overhead is what matters.

